<title>NETHERLANDS: Pakhoed breakdown of 1996 results.</title>
<headline>Pakhoed breakdown of 1996 results.</headline>
<dateline>ROTTERDAM 1997-03-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Dutch tank storage and shipping group Pakhoed NV gave the following breakdown of its 1996 results</p>
<p>(millions of guilders unless otherwise stated)</p>
<p>LOGISTICS</p>
<p>    - Turnover			    738.7  vs  743.3</p>
<p>    - Operating profit		  155.5  vs  174.6</p>
<p>DISTRIBUTION</p>
<p>    - Turnover (billion)		  2.52 vs    0.74</p>
<p>    - Operating profit		   81.5  vs   37.3</p>
<p>NON-CORE/HOLDING</p>
<p>    - Turnover			    335.7  vs  586.6</p>
<p>    - Operating loss			2.8  vs    1.5</p>
<p>-- Amsterdam newsroom +31 20 504 5000, Fax +31 20 504 5040</p>
</text>
